  "description": "Classic Western Style is a bold vintage display typeface inspired by traditional Wild West signage and old American frontier typography. It features strong slab-like serifs, sturdy letterforms, and a rugged, nostalgic character that evokes cowboy culture, saloons, and western posters. This font is perfect for logos, posters, headlines, packaging, apparel, signage, and branding projects that need an authentic western, rustic, or retro Americana look.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Classic Western Style is a bold vintage display typeface inspired by traditional Wild West signage and old American frontier typography. It features strong slab-like serifs, sturdy letterforms, and a rugged, nostalgic character that evokes cowboy culture, saloons, and western posters. This font is perfect for logos, posters, headlines, packaging, apparel, signage, and branding projects that need an authentic western, rustic, or retro Americana look.</p>",
